  "body": "Hi I have been asked to clarify the term Repair Techniques as mentioned in the document '[Understanding Success Criterion 4.1.1: Parsing](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/parsing)'. \r\n\r\n\"Since **repair techniques** vary among user agents, authors cannot assume that content will be accurately parsed into a data structure or that it will be rendered correctly by specialized user agents, including assistive technologies...\"\r\n\r\nCould this be added to a 'Key Terms' for the understanding document.",
